  "missionSettings": {
    "description": "One-on-one commander duel. Each side starts with a single highway airstrip, two vehicle depots and a handful of AA mounts. Every other airbase on the map is shut.\n\nThere is no pre-placed army and no pre-placed industry: you build your economy from scratch out of faction funds with the CORE Control BUILD window - gold mines for income, factories for units - buy ground forces at your depots, and take the fight to the other strip.\n\nWin by capturing the enemy airstrip. Mines and factories are buildings, so bombing the other commander's economy is as valid as shooting his tanks.\n\nRequires the CORE Control mod, and only the host can construct buildings.",
